author=Local
description=HighEnd launcher animations, per-app configurable Samsung native JNI blur support and original SM-S942B color-curve renderer for this SM-A576B build. Refreshes stale renderer mounts after updates; pins GLES with first-failure recovery. Zygisk Next and reboot required.
